# The IMAS-Core repository belongs in CMakeLists.txt: its location is stable;
# this file records only the moving revision CI and download-mode builds use.
#
# This fork pin preserves the HDF5 delete behaviour covered by issue #139 until
# upstream carries the required fix. Remove it when that fix is released and
# this project can return to an upstream release tag.
#
# To move the pin, replace only the first line with a verified 40-hex commit,
# then run the real-Core suite. That intentionally changes CI's cache key so it
# cannot restore a build of the old commit.
#
# This is not IMAS_CORE_VERSION: that file names the public ABI release the shim
# mirrors, while this one names the exact source revision download mode builds.
